	(footprint "Serenity-Custom:PocketBeagle2_2x18_P2_TSM-DV-LC"
		(layer "B.Cu")
		(uuid "a0e6b2eb-af2b-4863-8761-94ac91d4a52c")
		(at 148.5 117.7)
		(descr "Samtec TSM-118-04-L-DV-LC SMT male terminal strip (mates the PocketBeagle 2 Industrial female receptacles) per samtec_tsm-dv-footprint.pdf Rev F Fig. 1: 1.27 x 3.68 mm pads, inner pad edges +/-0.635 mm (centres +/-2.475 mm), 2.54 mm pitch; -LC locking-clip holes 1.19 mm NPTH at +/-20.32 mm on the centre-line ((N-2) x 2.54 / 2). Pin 1 at local +y (2026-10-17, Claude Opus 5.5): placed on B.Cu the KiCad flip mirrors y, which puts pin 1 on the board-north row - P1 OUTER row / P2 INNER row, as BeagleBoard pocketbeagle2 revA_dimension.pdf and the PB2 silkscreen show for the cape stacked on the PB2 back face (PB2 rotated 180 deg). The previous -y pin 1 swapped every odd/even pair.")
